    given-names: Federico
repository-code: "https://github.com/fcavaletto/prompt-injection-eval"
url: "https://fcavaletto.github.io/prompt-injection-eval/"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-10-01
abstract: >-
  A small local evaluation harness for indirect prompt injection in open-weight
  language models. It compares a baseline prompt with a generic document-trust
  defense using deterministic scorers. It is a diagnostic benchmark, not a
  production safety guarantee.
keywords:
  - prompt injection
  - language models
  - evaluation
  - ai safety
